{"images":["data:image/webp;base64,"],"messages":[{"content":"A large number of studies on the relationship between smoking and certain diseases conducted in a certain region are as follows.<image>Based on this information, the AR% comparing smoking and non-smoking in relation to the disease are\n\n(A) 48.0\n(B) 48.0-25.4=22.6\n(C) 48.0/25.4=1.89\n(D) (48.0-25.4) /48.0\n\nAnswer with the option's letter from the given choices directly.","role":"user"}]}